  "published": "2026-04-30T13:21:28.263Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "📦 VDocs – Release Notes\n🚀 Version: 2026.4.2\n- Fixed built-in style mapping from XML to DOM\n  Resolved an issue where certain built‑in Word styles (e.g., heading, normal, caption) were not correctly mapped from the underlying WordprocessingML to the VDocs DOM. This affected document loading and style fidelity when editing or exporting documents. Styles are now fully preserved and round‑tripped correctly.\n\n🚀 Improvements\n - Enhanced XML parsing performance for large documents with many built‑in styles.\n\n - Improved error logging during style resolution to assist with debugging.\n\n⚠️ Breaking Changes\n - None. This release is fully backward‑compatible.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
  "title": "VDocs - Word Document Framework",
